#VAR(Table, TABLE)
#ADDTBL("../encoding.tbl", Table)
#ACTIVETBL(Table)
#VAR(PTR, CUSTOMPOINTER)
#CREATEPTR(PTR, "LINEAR", 0, 16)
#JMP($0000394C)

#WRITE(PTR, $0000297C)
This was Suimei Private Academy, the school I went to.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000298C)
Apparently it’d only been built around ten years ago, so it didn’t%N
exactly have a rich history or anything like that.%K%N
Since it still looked brand new, it made a pretty good setting for%N
high school TV shows.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000299C)
On top of that, the school uniforms had apparently been designed by%N
some famous designer. A ton of shallow-ass girls enrolled just so%N
that they could wear it.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000029AC)
And while they called it a prep school, most students here didn’t%N
score much higher than the national average.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000029BC)
Even more ironic, though, was that the school slogan was%N
“Here You’ll Be Free,” and yet the school rules were actually%N
really strict.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000029CC)
Then again, they never actually bothered enforcing those rules.%K
<LINE>
So I guess the slogan wasn’t really wrong in the end.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000029DC)
I mean, I barely ever showed up, and I passed my classes just%N
fine. If you could get away with that, you could probably get%N
away with anything.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000029EC)
As I closed in on the school, I could hear the other students%N
more and more clearly.%N
I wasn’t good at dealing with crowds, so I just kept my head%N
low as I slipped through the gate.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002A5E)
*Nobody talk to me.* *Nobody talk to me.*%N
I repeated those words in my head like a mantra.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002A6E)
My younger sister also attended this school,%N
though she still lived with my parents.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002A7E)
Run into her, and any perfectly fine day could%N
turn into a nightmare.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002B3E)
Luckily, I hadn’t run into *her* this time;%N
I made it to class safe and sound.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002C40)
I rushed over to my seat,%N
being extra careful not to make eye contact with anyone.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002C50)
I could feel a nearby group of girls shoot a glance at me,%N
but thankfully, they went right back to chatting afterward.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002C60)
They all thought I was a freak. I was sure of it.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002C70)
Well, from my point of view,%N
you 3D sluts are the real freaks here.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002C80)
If you think I’m a freak, then don’t look at me.
<LINE>
Just pretend like I’m not here. Don’t acknowledge me at all.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002C90)
If you all just do that, then I won’t bother you either,%N
and I can go about my day in peace.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002CA0)
That’s why it always confuses me when I see DQNs calling people%N
freaks. I just don’t get it.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002CB0)
If you think they’re such a freak, then why even bother talking%N
to them? Just stay in your corner, and they’ll stay in theirs.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002D26)
Regardless, I was just sitting there,%N
looking down at my desk, when...
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002DB6)
【三住】
“Yo, Taku!”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002DC6)
...someone suddenly clapped me on the back.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002DD6)
Startled, I turned to look behind me.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002E28)
【三住】
“Didn’t know you were comin’ in today.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002E38)
【拓巳】
“O-Oh, Misumi-kun...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002E48)
It was Misumi Daisuke, one of my classmates.%N
He shot me a friendly smile from beside my desk.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002E58)
The guy was pretty handsome, so all the girls were into him.%N
But he was also into them, and dated them. A lot of them.%N
Usually multiple at a time.%N
If you asked me, he was balls-deep into DQN territory.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002E68)
If it were up to me, I’d steer clear of him, but...
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002EA8)
【三住】
“You’re lookin’ as grim as ever.%N
 You stay up all nightplaying games again?”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002EB8)
【拓巳】
“N-Not really...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002EC8)
He was the only person in the class who was comfortable%N
talking to me.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002ED8)
Though we had absolutely nothing in common,%N
so I had no idea why he bothered.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002EE8)
I’d been suspicious about it ever since the school year began.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002EF8)
If I were a girl, I could maybe understand,%N
but since I was a guy, it made no sense to me.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002F38)
【三住】
“I know it’s hard since you’re a shut-in and all,%N
 but you should reaaally try to speak up.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002F48)
I would if I could.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002F58)
Just the act of talking to another 3D human being was painful.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002F68)
Anxiety made it hard for me to speak naturally,
<LINE>
my lack of experience made it hard for me to articulate things,
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002F78)
and I was always afraid of being teased for saying something%N
weird. That was why I always shrunk back.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002F88)
You have no idea how much pain I’m going through,%N
so please don’t talk like you know me...
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002F98)
Also, I’m not a goddamn shut-in. *Real* shut-ins stay in their%N
rooms 24 hours a day, 365 days a year. I’m not like that.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002FD8)
【三住】
“I mean, I can understand feelin’ nervous around chicks, but%N
 if you keep stuttering like that around *me*, people might%N
 start thinkin’ we’re gay.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002FE8)
【拓巳】
“H-Huh...?”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002FF8)
Wait, was he just dating girls as a cover?%N
Had he been into guys all along?!
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000301A)
I tried to back away from him, nearly falling out of my%N
chair in the process, but I quickly grabbed on to my%N
desk to catch myself.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000302A)
【三住】
“The hell’re you doin’, dude?”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000303A)
【拓巳】
“M-Misumi-kun... are you... gay?”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000307A)
【三住】
“What? No way in hell!%N
 Did you forget all the chicks I’ve landed?”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000308A)
【拓巳】
“R-Right... Phew, that was terrifying...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000030CA)
【三住】
“Speakin’ of landin’ chicks...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000030DA)
Misumi-kun took a quick look around,%N
then lowered his voice and grinned from ear to ear.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000030EA)
【三住】
“I just bagged my third girl from this class.%N
 Wanna know who?”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000030FA)
【拓巳】
“N-Not really, no...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000310A)
【三住】
“Come on, you can at least pretend to care.%N
 It was Tanaka, man. *Tanaka.*”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000311A)
【拓巳】
“...Who’s Tanaka?”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000315A)
【三住】
“Do you seriously not know the names of our classmates by now?%N
 It’s nearly October, dude.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000316A)
【三住】
“Well, you say you’re not into 3D girls,%N
 so I guess it makes sense.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000317A)
Visibly frustrated,%N
he shrugged his shoulders and let out a sigh.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000318A)
Well, interestingly enough, he never insulted my taste in%N
girls—which was, to put it simply, that they had to be from%N
the second dimension.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000319A)
But he’d never called me a freak for that—he just didn’t%N
bother with things that didn’t interest him.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000031AA)
That was what made me think he may not’ve been all that bad.%N
That was also probably the reason why I didn’t mind talking%N
to him. 
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000031EA)
【三住】
“Anyway, I’ve pretty much scored on every cute girl in this%N
 class by now.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000031FA)
【三住】
“I think it’s about time I start headin’ next door.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000320A)
...Okay, maybe he *was* pretty bad.
<LINE>
If a girl overheard some of the shit he said,%N
she’d be horrified.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000324A)
【三住】
“There’s a real hot one in Class D, but it%N
 doesn’t look like she comes to school much.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000325A)
【三住】
“Ain’t got much in the chest though.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000326A)
【三住】
“Now that I think about it, though,%N
 aren’t you into flat girls anyway?”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000327A)
...Are you talking about 2D? That’s not... Whatever.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000032BA)
【三住】
“All right, all right. New topic.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000032D0)
【三住】
“Have you heard about New Gen?”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000032EC)
I hadn’t expected to hear those words come out of his mouth.%K
<LINE>
And here I’d thought he was only capable of thinking about%N
girls.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000032FC)
I couldn’t even picture him watching the news%N
or reading the newspaper.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000330C)
【三住】
“There’s been some rumors that the Group Dive wasn’t actually a%Nsuicide.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000331C)
【拓巳】
“O-Oh...?”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000332C)
【三住】
“Yeah. That’s what Sports Tokyo said.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003354)
What, so his 
<DICT>
source
</DICT>
 was Sports Tokyo?
<LINE>
That kinda erased any and all credibility.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000336C)
Still, I’d already known about that rumor.%N
Not that I cared.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000337C)
【三住】
“Okay, now listen closely, this is the good part—an%N
 eyewitness said that the killer’s a chick, and a real%N
 hottie at that, too.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000338C)
【拓巳】
“A chick...?”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000339C)
Watching Misumi-kun get so excited, it finally hit me.%K
<LINE>
Why did he suddenly care enough to read Sports Tokyo?
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000033AC)
Same reason he cared about anything else—something to%N
do with girls. What a twist.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000033BC)
I guess Misumi-kun would even go after serial killers,%N
as long as they were cute...
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000033CC)
I mean, if it were me, I’d take a cute *2D* serial%N
killer, but...
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000033E4)
Misumi-kun stared longingly at the blue sky%N
outside the window.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000033F4)
Then, for some reason, his face suddenly lit up%N
as if he’d reached enlightenment itself.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003404)
【三住】
“Really though, I wonder what kinda person the murderer is. 
<LINE>
 Is she really a cutie? If she is, then I *really* wanna%N
 meet her.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003414)
Yeah, this dude definitely thought exclusively with the%N
wrong head.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003424)
【三住】
“I know she wouldn’t kill me. I mean, look at me. I’ve got the%Nlooks, and chicks dig me. No matter how many people she’s killed,%Nshe’d definitely fall in love with a nice guy like me.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003434)
And *that’s* why she wouldn’t kill you...?
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003444)
This guy was so delusional that he gave *me* a run for my money.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003454)
The fact that he was able to say all that without even a hint of%Nirony was honestly pretty gross.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003464)
【拓巳】
“I-I... don’t really care...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000034A4)
【三住】
“The hell do you mean you ‘don’t really care’? You know the killer%Nis somewhere in this city, right? It might even be someone you’ve%Nmet before.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000034B4)
Yeah, well, for all I know, *you* could be the murderer.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000034C4)
...Okay, probably not. But it was entirely possible that the%Nkiller could be one of the students at this very school...
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000034EC)
If that turned out to be true, maybe I’d use my “
<DICT>
PTSD
</DICT>
” as an%Nexcuse to come in less often without hurting my attendance.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003534)
【三住】
“So, wanna check out the crime scene with me?%NIt’s close enough to walk to from here.%NI hear they haven’t even finished cleaning up the blood yet.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003544)
I had absolutely zero interest in doing that.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003554)
I just wanted to get through school in peace, go home, greet%NSeira-tan, and get back to being worshipped like a god in Baselard.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003564)
【三住】
“C’mon, even Kobashi and Hasegawa have gone to see it.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003574)
【拓巳】
“I really don’t want to...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000375C)
I felt bad about turning Misumi-kun down, since he seemed%Nso excited about it, but I really *did not* want to go.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000376C)
But even though I was trying my hardest to refuse,
<LINE>
he just wasn’t listening.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000377C)
【三住】
“Maybe we’ll even see the murderer.
<LINE>
They say the criminal always returns to the scene of the%N
crime, right?”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000378C)
【三住】
“Heh, maybe she’d pick you as her next victim. ‘To atone%N
 for your sins, you must DIE!’ Y’know, that kinda thing.%N
 As for your sins, though... hmm... being a shut-in!”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000379C)
【拓巳】
“...”
<END>
